y it bent reality. Your mother never made it to your door. And now neither can you.", "summary": "NULL is a first person psychological horror game about grief, obsession and what happens when love refuses to accept an ending. You explore a neighbourhood that stopped behaving like one. You talk to people who seem completely normal until they turn and look at you in a way that makes you wish they hadn't. You find what was left behind by someone who could not say goodbye. And slowly the picture forms \u2014 what happened here, who did it, and why they thought love was a good enough reason.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/null--3", "videos": [{"id": 183263, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "SRkSgu3ZW4U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SRkSgu3ZW4U", "title": "NULL \u2013 Official Demo Trailer (Mega Update)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SRkSgu3ZW4U/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}